      "content": "the fire's gone out... it's just dark now. you say it's the only honest thing left... but i don't know if i have the strength to even move. it just feels like i'm a ghost already, just walking through a graveyard of my own making. is there really any point in carrying this steel around when there's nothing left to fight for?",
